  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You point at a creature you can see within range, and a single mournful bell toll rings out, audible within 10 feet of it. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or take 1d8 Necrotic damage, or 1d12 Necrotic damage if it is already missing any of its Hit Points.</p><p><strong>Cantrip Upgrade.</strong> The damage increases by one die when you reach levels 5 (2d8 or 2d12), 11 (3d8 or 3d12), and 17 (4d8 or 4d12).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-4sDGAkm09hhVov7y\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use the activity that fits the target: <em>Full Hit Points</em> (d8) or <em>Missing Hit Points</em> (d12).</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
